{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38632","headline":"秋霖歌 · 李沇","name":"秋霖歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西方龙儿口犹乳，初解驱云学行雨。\n纵恣羣阴驾老虬，勺水蹄涔尽奔注。\n叶破苔黄未休滴，腻光透长狂莎色。\n恨无长劒一千仞，划断顽云看晴碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}